OL,3,AFive killed in Miami plane crash were
OL,4,Ain two vehicles on ground,
OL,5,Ainvestigators say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe five people killed and five injured
OL,8,Fwhen an Amazon cargo plane crashed on
OL,9,Flanding at Miami International Airport
OL,10,Fwere in two vehicles on the ground,
OL,11,Finvestigators said.
OL,13,FThe Boeing 767-300, operated by 21 Air,
OL,14,Fovershot the runway on Sunday and hit
OL,15,Fan airline cleaning van holding seven
OL,16,Fpeople before breaking the perimeter
OL,17,Ffence and striking a Toyota SUV with
OL,18,Fthree inside.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
