OL,3,AFive killed in Miami plane crash were
OL,4,Ain two vehicles on ground,
OL,5,Ainvestigators say
OL,6,
OL,7,FJennifer Homendy, chairwoman of the
OL,8,FNational Transportation Safety Board
OL,9,F(NTSB), called the crash scene "utter
OL,10,Fdevastation" and said it was too early
OL,11,Fto identify a cause.
OL,13,FInvestigators have recovered the flight
OL,14,Frecorders and will look at flight
OL,15,Fsystems, crew experience and weather as
OL,16,Fpotential factors, say aviation
OL,17,Fexperts.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
